===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Kiga}}, {{l|de|KiGa}} {{q|short for: '''Ki'''nder'''ga'''rten}}

===Etymology===
{{affix|de|Kind|-er-|Garten|t1=child|t3=garden}}. Coined by {{l|de|Friedrich Fröbel}} in the metaphorical sense of "place where children can grow in a natural way", not in the literal sense of "garden".

